@startuml
actor User
participant Browser
participant "App server" as App
participant "Auth server" as Auth
participant "Resource API" as Res
User -> Browser : Click Sign in
Browser -> App : GET /login
App --> Browser : 302 redirect to /authorize
Browser -> Auth : GET /authorize
Auth --> Browser : Login page
User -> Browser : Enter credentials
Browser -> Auth : POST /login
Auth --> Browser : 302 redirect with code
Browser -> App : GET /callback?code
App -> Auth : POST /token
Auth --> App : access token
App -> Res : GET /profile
Res --> App : profile JSON
@enduml
